description:
On behalf of our clients, we are seeking permission to carry out internal refurbishment works and a rear kitchen extension at Flat 1, 27 Compayne Gardens, NW6 3DD (ground floor).
Internal works include:
Replacement of all existing windows with like-for-like double-glazed units;
Repositioning and enlargement of one rear window, to be replaced with a like-for-like double-glazed unit;
Alterations to the internal layout, including associated changes to window openings.
External works include:
Construction of a rear garden extension (approximately 13 sqm);
Installation of air-conditioning units;
Installation of an air-source heat pump;
Installation of an electric vehicle charging point;
Removal of one tree within the rear garden.
We previously submitted a Pre-Application Planning Advice request and paid the Minor Development fee under case reference 2025/4404/PRE. Following discussions with a member of the planning team, we were advised to contact you directly with our reference number and submission form (attached) to confirm the appropriate next steps.
We would be grateful for your guidance on how to proceed.
